                      </span><span class="se-fs- se-ff-   " id="SE-5ce771b0-cffe-4b7e-a15a-0e89b6558c54" style="box-sizing: unset; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-style: inherit; font-variant: inherit; font-weight: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 15px; line-height: inherit; font-family: se-nanumgothic, arial, &quot;\\B098눔고딕&quot;, nanumgothic, sans-serif; font-optical-sizing: inherit; font-size-adjust: inherit; font-kerning: inherit; font-feature-settings: inherit; font-variation-settings: inherit; font-language-override: inherit; vertical-align: baseline; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><u style="box-sizing: unset; text-decoration: underline; text-decoration-skip-ink: none; background-color: inherit; font-family: inherit;">네이버 공식 발표 기준</u></span></p><p class="se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- " id="SE-cd6eb4c4-cd6e-4bfa-a5a2-70388295e89d" style="margin: 0px; padding: 0px; box-sizing: unset; border: 0px; font-style: inherit; font-variant: inherit; font-weight: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 11px; line-height: 1.8; font-family: inherit; font-optical-sizing: inherit; font-size-adjust: inherit; font-kerning: inherit; font-feature-settings: inherit; font-variation-settings: inherit; font-language-override: inherit; vertical-align: baseline; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: break-word; white-space: break-spaces; text-align: left;"><span class="se-fs- se-ff-   " id="SE-cfc44c5b-7cfd-475f-9ad3-b6fcf9ed946a" style="box-sizing: unset; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-style: inherit; font-variant: inherit; font-weight: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 15px; line-height: inherit; font-family: se-nanumgothic, arial, &quot;\\B098눔고딕&quot;, nanumgothic, sans-serif; font-optical-sizing: inherit; font-size-adjust: inherit; font-kerning: inherit; font-feature-settings: inherit; font-variation-settings: inherit; font-language-override: inherit; vertical-align: baseline; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><u style="box-sizing: unset; text-decoration: underline; text-decoration-skip-ink: none; background-color: inherit; font-family: inherit;">​</u></span></p><p class="se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- " id="SE-12b490d1-65f8-4435-8181-627ba88efa35" style="margin: 0px; padding: 0px; box-sizing: unset; border: 0px; font-style: inherit; font-variant: inherit; font-weight: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 11px; line-height: 1.8; font-family: inherit; font-optical-sizing: inherit; font-size-adjust: inherit; font-kerning: inherit; font-feature-settings: inherit; font-variation-settings: inherit; font-language-override: inherit; vertical-align: baseline; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: break-word; white-space: break-spaces; text-align: left;"><span class="se-fs- se-ff-   se-decoration-unset" id="SE-835fad55-0d27-4782-8d81-186b8cb59604" style="box-sizing: unset; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-style: inherit; font-variant: inherit; font-weight: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 15px; line-height: inherit; font-family: se-nanumgothic, arial, &quot;\\B098눔고딕&quot;, nanumgothic, sans-serif; font-optical-sizing: inherit; font-size-adjust: inherit; font-kerning: inherit; font-feature-settings: inherit; font-variation-settings: inherit; font-language-override: inherit; vertical-align: baseline; text-decoration: none !important; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">2025년에는 네이버 블로그에 약 3억 3천만 건의 글이 발행됐습니다. 블로그는 여전히 국내에서 대규모로 이용되는 정보 탐색·콘텐츠 플랫폼입니다.</span></p><p class="se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- " id="SE-9f61fff9-0702-4002-8e62-af4f3d5b2824" style="margin: 0px; padding: 0px; box-sizing: unset; border: 0px; font-style: inherit; font-variant: inherit; font-weight: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 11px; line-height: 1.8; font-family: inherit; font-optical-sizing: inherit; font-size-adjust: inherit; font-kerning: inherit; font-feature-settings: inherit; font-variation-settings: inherit; font-language-override: inherit; vertical-align: baseline; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: break-word; white-space: break-spaces; text-align: left;"><span class="se-fs- se-ff-   se-decoration-unset" id="SE-4630408e-a8ed-47fb-bdb2-3f4ed78cc7f6" style="box-sizing: unset; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-style: inherit; font-variant: inherit; font-weight: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 15px; line-height: inherit; font-family: se-nanumgothic, arial, &quot;\\B098눔고딕&quot;, nanumgothic, sans-serif; font-optical-sizing: inherit; font-size-adjust: inherit; font-kerning: inherit; font-feature-settings: inherit; font-variation-settings: inherit; font-language-override: inherit; vertical-align: baseline; text-decoration: none !important; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">​</span></p><p class="se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- " id="SE-1bc25907-1127-4494-afef-9ea1a57a14d4" style="margin: 0px; padding: 0px; box-sizing: unset; border: 0px; font-style: inherit; font-variant: inherit; font-weight: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 11px; line-height: 1.8; font-family: inherit; font-optical-sizing: inherit; font-size-adjust: inherit; font-kerning: inherit; font-feature-settings: inherit; font-variation-settings: inherit; font-language-override: inherit; vertical-align: baseline; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: break-word; white-space: break-spaces; text-align: left;"><span class="se-fs- se-ff-   se-decoration-unset" id="SE-55e900bd-e1c0-4f8d-b82b-19d6f4f436a0" style="box-sizing: unset; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-style: inherit; font-variant: inherit; font-weight: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 15px; line-height: inherit; font-family: se-nanumgothic, arial, &quot;\\B098눔고딕&quot;, nanumgothic, sans-serif; font-optical-sizing: inherit; font-size-adjust: inherit; font-kerning: inherit; font-feature-settings: inherit; font-variation-settings: inherit; font-language-override: inherit; vertical-align: baseline; text-decoration: none !important; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">물론 네이버 검색 유입 점유율 66.8%는 일부 웹사이트를 대상으로 측정한 수치이며, 네이버 검색 이용자가 모두 블로그 콘텐츠를 소비한다는 의미는 아닙니다.</span></p><p class="se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- " id="SE-178cd1d7-5e0a-47d6-bf4d-67ca9ff08146" style="margin: 0px; padding: 0px; box-sizing: unset; border: 0px; font-style: inherit; font-variant: inherit; font-weight: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 11px; line-height: 1.8; font-family: inherit; font-optical-sizing: inherit; font-size-adjust: inherit; font-kerning: inherit; font-feature-settings: inherit; font-variation-settings: inherit; font-language-override: inherit; vertical-align: baseline; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: break-word; white-space: break-spaces; text-align: left;"><span class="se-fs- se-ff-   se-decoration-unset" id="SE-6a922e5f-d6a1-405e-b5dc-57d3376cab76" style="box-sizing: unset; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-style: inherit; font-variant: inherit; font-weight: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 15px; line-height: inherit; font-family: se-nanumgothic, arial, &quot;\\B098눔고딕&quot;, nanumgothic, sans-serif; font-optical-sizing: inherit; font-size-adjust: inherit; font-kerning: inherit; font-feature-settings: inherit; font-variation-settings: inherit; font-language-override: inherit; vertical-align: baseline; text-decoration: none !important; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><b style="box-sizing: unset; font-weight: 700; background-color: inherit; font-family: inherit;">​</b></span></p><p class="se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- " id="SE-d61c4b23-3750-44e6-bf57-ec5f3e9cdd01" style="margin: 0px; padding: 0px; box-sizing: unset; border: 0px; font-style: inherit; font-variant: inherit; font-weight: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 11px; line-height: 1.8; font-family: inherit; font-optical-sizing: inherit; font-size-adjust: inherit; font-kerning: inherit; font-feature-settings: inherit; font-variation-settings: inherit; font-language-override: inherit; vertical-align: baseline; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: break-word; white-space: break-spaces; text-align: left;"><span class="se-fs- se-ff-   se-decoration-unset" id="SE-f42afb55-5528-4706-b694-d0c12d089555" style="box-sizing: unset; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-style: inherit; font-variant: inherit; font-weight: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 15px; line-height: inherit; font-family: se-nanumgothic, arial, &quot;\\B098눔고딕&quot;, nanumgothic, sans-serif; font-optical-sizing: inherit; font-size-adjust: inherit; font-kerning: inherit; font-feature-settings: inherit; font-variation-settings: inherit; font-language-override: inherit; vertical-align: baseline; text-decoration: none !important; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><b style="box-sizing: unset; font-weight: 700; background-color: inherit; font-family: inherit;">하지만 중요한 것은 고객들이 여전히 네이버에서 제품과 서비스를 검색하고, 구매를 결정하기 위한 정보를 탐색한다는 사실입니다.</b></span></p><p class="se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- " id="SE-677fd0a1-a1ff-41d2-90d2-b736051b482e" style="margin: 0px; padding: 0px; box-sizing: unset; border: 0px; font-style: inherit; font-variant: inherit; font-weight: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 11px; line-height: 1.8; font-family: inherit; font-optical-sizing: inherit; font-size-adjust: inherit; font-kerning: inherit; font-feature-settings: inherit; font-variation-settings: inherit; font-language-override: inherit; vertical-align: baseline; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: break-word; white-space: break-spaces; text-align: left;"><span class="se-fs- se-ff-   se-decoration-unset" id="SE-bbb2d33c-b31a-435a-a4a3-8034d27cdeb4" style="box-sizing: unset; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-style: inherit; font-variant: inherit; font-weight: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 15px; line-height: inherit; font-family: se-nanumgothic, arial, &quot;\\B098눔고딕&quot;, nanumgothic, sans-serif; font-optical-sizing: inherit; font-size-adjust: inherit; font-kerning: inherit; font-feature-settings: inherit; font-variation-settings: inherit; font-language-override: inherit; vertical-align: baseline; text-decoration: none !important; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">기업 입장에서는 고객이 정보를 찾는 플랫폼에 자사의 전문성과 제품·서비스의 가치를 전달할 수 있는 콘텐츠를 꾸준히 쌓아야 할 충분한 이유가 있습니다.</span></p><p class="se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- " id="SE-16d71c4b-c22d-466f-b527-9c8cba6b5b29" style="margin: 0px; padding: 0px; box-sizing: unset; border: 0px; font-style: inherit; font-variant: inherit; font-weight: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 11px; line-height: 1.8; font-family: inherit; font-optical-sizing: inherit; font-size-adjust: inherit; font-kerning: inherit; font-feature-settings: inherit; font-variation-settings: inherit; font-language-override: inherit; vertical-align: baseline; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: break-word; white-space: break-spaces; text-align: left;"><span class="se-fs- se-ff-   se-decoration-unset" id="SE-559a71a5-9630-47d2-96f3-a3c9dfa847c9" style="box-sizing: unset; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-style: inherit; font-variant: inherit; font-weight: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 15px; line-height: inherit; font-family: se-nanumgothic, arial, &quot;\\B098눔고딕&quot;, nanumgothic, sans-serif; font-optical-sizing: inherit; font-size-adjust: inherit; font-kerning: inherit; font-feature-settings: inherit; font-variation-settings: inherit; font-language-override: inherit; vertical-align: baseline; text-decoration: none !important;">​</span></p></div></div></div></div><div class="se-component se-quotation se-l-quotation_line" id="SE-4d96e7c0-081d-4c41-81b5-40fd97a088ef" style="box-sizing: unset; margin: 40px 0px 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-variant-numeric: inherit; font-variant-east-asian: inherit; font-variant-alternates: inherit; font-variant-position: inherit; font-variant-emoji: inherit; font-weight: 400; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 12px; line-height: inherit; font-family: se-nanumgothic, arial, 나눔고딕, nanumgothic, sans-serif, Meiryo; font-optical-sizing: inherit; font-size-adjust: inherit; font-kerning: inherit; font-feature-settings: inherit; font-variation-settings: inherit; font-language-override: inherit; vertical-align: baseline; position: relative; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: left; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;"><div class="se-component-content" style="box-sizing: unset; margin: 0px auto; padding: 0px 40px; border: 0px; font: inherit; vertical-align: baseline; max-width: 100%; position: relative;"><div class="se-section se-section-quotation se-l-quotation_line" style="box-sizing: unset; margin: 0px auto; padding: 10px 0px; border: 0px; font: inherit; vertical-align: baseline;"><blockquote class="se-quotation-container" style="box-sizing: border-box; margin: auto; padding: 0px 20px; border: 0px; font: inherit; vertical-align: baseline; quotes: none; position: relative;"><div class="se-module se-module-text se-quote" style="box-sizing: unset; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font: inherit; vertical-align: baseline;"><p class="se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- " id="SE-0aaeccf6-b963-4aba-bd65-e4f1bb526439" style="margin: 0px; padding: 0px; box-sizing: unset; border: 0px; font-style: inherit; font-variant: inherit; font-weight: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 11px; line-height: 1.8; font-family: inherit; font-optical-sizing: inherit; font-size-adjust: inherit; font-kerning: inherit; font-feature-settings: inherit; font-variation-settings: inherit; font-language-override: inherit; vertical-align: baseline; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: break-word; white-space: break-spaces; text-align: left;"><span class="se-fs-fs24 se-ff-   " id="SE-120b7394-8906-4a94-bdb0-2d1c2d77a082" style="box-sizing: unset; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-style: inherit; font-variant: inherit; font-weight: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 24px; line-height: inherit; font-family: se-nanumgothic, arial, &quot;\\B098눔고딕&quot;, nanumgothic, sans-serif; font-optical-sizing: inherit; font-size-adjust: inherit; font-kerning: inherit; font-feature-settings: inherit; font-variation-settings: inherit; font-language-override: inherit; vertical-align: baseline; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">2. 기업이 네이버 블로그를 운영해야 하는 4가지 이유</span></p></div></blockquote></div></div></div><div class="se-component se-image se-l-default __se-component" id="SE-431eccea-47a3-41fc-bd4a-9403b6aa3f0d" style="box-sizing: unset; margin: 40px 0px 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-variant-numeric: inherit; font-variant-east-asian: inherit; font-variant-alternates: inherit; font-variant-position: inherit; font-variant-emoji: inherit; font-weight: 400; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 12px; line-height: inherit; font-family: se-nanumgothic, arial, 나눔고딕, nanumgothic, sans-serif, Meiryo; font-optical-sizing: inherit; font-size-adjust: inherit; font-kerning: inherit; font-feature-settings: inherit; font-variation-settings: inherit; font-language-override: inherit; vertical-align: baseline; position: relative; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: left; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;"><div class="se-component-content se-component-content-fit" style="box-sizing: unset; margin: 0px auto; padding: 0px 40px; border: 0px; font: inherit; vertical-align: baseline; max-width: 100%;"><div class="se-section se-section-image se-l-default 