l; font-variant-numeric: inherit; font-variant-east-asian: inherit; font-variant-alternates: inherit; font-variant-position: inherit; font-variant-emoji: inherit; font-weight: 400; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 12px; line-height: inherit; font-family: se-nanumgothic, arial, 나눔고딕, nanumgothic, sans-serif, Meiryo; font-optical-sizing: inherit; font-size-adjust: inherit; font-kerning: inherit; font-feature-settings: inherit; font-variation-settings: inherit; font-language-override: inherit; vertical-align: baseline; position: relative; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: left; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;"><div class="se-component-content" style="box-sizing: unset; margin: 0px auto; padding: 0px 40px; border: 0px; font: inherit; vertical-align: baseline; max-width: 100%; position: relative;"><div class="se-section se-section-quotation se-l-quotation_underline" style="box-sizing: unset; margin: 0px auto; padding: 10px 0px; border: 0px; font: inherit; vertical-align: baseline;"><blockquote class="se-quotation-container" style="box-sizing: border-box; margin: auto; padding: 35px 0px 20px; border-width: 0px 0px 1px; border-style: none none solid; border-color: currentcolor currentcolor rgb(155, 155, 155); border-image: none; font: inherit; vertical-align: baseline; quotes: none; position: relative;"><div class="se-module se-module-text se-quote" style="box-sizing: unset; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font: inherit; vertical-align: baseline;"><p class="se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- " id="SE-064699a6-e6d9-49c4-b4f0-03498d46531d" style="margin: 0px; padding: 0px; box-sizing: unset; border: 0px; font-style: inherit; font-variant: inherit; font-weight: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 11px; line-height: 1.8; font-family: inherit; font-optical-sizing: inherit; font-size-adjust: inherit; font-kerning: inherit; font-feature-settings: inherit; font-variation-settings: inherit; font-language-override: inherit; vertical-align: baseline; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: break-word; white-space: break-spaces; text-align: left;"><span class="se-fs- se-ff-   " id="SE-342bceb7-a8e6-480e-b369-615d50227503" style="box-sizing: unset; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-style: inherit; font-variant: inherit; font-weight: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 19px; line-height: inherit; font-family: se-nanummyeongjo, arial, &quot;\\B098눔명조&quot;, nanummyeongjo, serif; font-optical-sizing: inherit; font-size-adjust: inherit; font-kerning: inherit; font-feature-settings: inherit; font-variation-settings: inherit; font-language-override: inherit; vertical-align: baseline; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">1. 잠재 고객 확보 : 좋은 제품을 만들어도, 검색되지 않으면 고객은 알 수 없습니다.</span></p></div></blockquote></div></div></div><div class="se-component se-text se-l-default" id="SE-bfd19014-5548-4c8d-80e2-892d3299469e" style="box-sizing: unset; margin: 40px 0px 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-variant-numeric: inherit; font-variant-east-asian: inherit; font-variant-alternates: inherit; font-variant-position: inherit; font-variant-emoji: inherit; font-weight: 400; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 12px; line-height: inherit; font-family: se-nanumgothic, arial, 나눔고딕, nanumgothic, sans-serif, Meiryo; font-optical-sizing: inherit; font-size-adjust: inherit; font-kerning: inherit; font-feature-settings: inherit; font-variation-settings: inherit; font-language-override: inherit; vertical-align: baseline; position: relative; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: left; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;"><div class="se-component-content" style="box-sizing: unset; margin: 0px auto; padding: 0px 40px; border: 0px; font: inherit; vertical-align: baseline; max-width: 100%;"><div class="se-section se-section-text se-l-default" style="box-sizing: unset; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font: inherit; vertical-align: baseline;"><div class="se-module se-module-text" style="box-sizing: unset; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font: inherit; vertical-align: baseline;"><p class="se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- " id="SE-5fb9fc0a-2420-45a9-828e-c6d175358273" style="margin: 0px; padding: 0px; box-sizing: unset; border: 0px; font-style: inherit; font-variant: inherit; font-weight: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 11px; line-height: 1.8; font-family: inherit; font-optical-sizing: inherit; font-size-adjust: inherit; font-kerning: inherit; font-feature-settings: inherit; font-variation-settings: inherit; font-language-override: inherit; vertical-align: baseline; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: break-word; white-space: break-spaces; text-align: left;"><span class="se-fs- se-ff-   se-decoration-unset" id="SE-94e3fa77-8e08-42a4-8bf8-62a6d9a175c4" style="box-sizing: unset; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-style: inherit; font-variant: inherit; font-weight: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 15px; line-height: inherit; font-family: se-nanumgothic, arial, &quot;\\B098눔고딕&quot;, nanumgothic, sans-serif; font-optical-sizing: inherit; font-size-adjust: inherit; font-kerning: inherit; font-feature-settings: inherit; font-variation-settings: inherit; font-language-override: inherit; vertical-align: baseline; text-decoration: none !important; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">아무리 뛰어난 제품과 서비스를 제공하더라도, 잠재 고객이 우리 기업을 발견하지 못한다면 새로운 고객을 확보하기 어렵습니다.</span></p><p class="se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- " id="SE-d800457e-586b-426f-a1da-e156fad123c7" style="margin: 0px; padding: 0px; box-sizing: unset; border: 0px; font-style: inherit; font-variant: inherit; font-weight: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 11px; line-height: 1.8; font-family: inherit; font-optical-sizing: inherit; font-size-adjust: inherit; font-kerning: inherit; font-feature-settings: inherit; font-variation-settings: inherit; font-language-override: inherit; vertical-align: baseline; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: break-word; white-space: break-spaces; text-align: left;"><span class="se-fs- se-ff-   se-decoration-unset" id="SE-d5803a87-6382-4d91-8ef0-e32f238eaccc" style="box-sizing: unset; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-style: inherit; font-variant: inherit; font-weight: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 15px; line-height: inherit; font-family: se-nanumgothic, arial, &quot;\\B098눔고딕&quot;, nanumgothic, sans-serif; font-optical-sizing: inherit; font-size-adjust: inherit; font-kerning: inherit; font-feature-settings: inherit; font-variation-settings: inherit; font-language-override: inherit; vertical-align: baseline; text-decoration: none !important; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">​</span></p><p class="se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- " id="SE-d64e1b1f-a785-4419-b63f-85e4a8441c40" style="margin: 0px; padding: 0px; box-sizing: unset; border: 0px; font-style: inherit; font-variant: inherit; font-weight: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 11px; line-height: 1.8; font-family: inherit; font-optical-sizing: inherit; font-size-adjust: inherit; font-kerning: inherit; font-feature-settings: inherit; font-variation-settings: inherit; font-language-override: inherit; vertical-align: baseline; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: break-word; white-space: break-spaces; text-align: left;"><span class="se-fs- se-ff-   se-decoration-unset" id="SE-35290804-e065-4189-92ac-f7dfbc07ec39" style="box-sizing: unset; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-style: inherit; font-variant: inherit; font-weight: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 15px; line-height: inherit; font-family: se-nanumgothic, arial, &quot;\\B098눔고딕&quot;, nanumgothic, sans-serif; font-optical-sizing: inherit; font-size-adjust: inherit; font-kerning: inherit; font-feature-settings: inherit; font-variation-settings: inherit; font-language-override: inherit; vertical-align: baseline; text-decoration: none !important; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">기업 홈페이지는 주로 회사를 알고 찾아온 고객에게 정보를 제공하는 역할을 합니다. 반면 </span><span class="se-fs- se-ff-   se-decoration-unset" id="SE-a3765faf-e82c-4daa-8bfb-d90821e546d5" style="box-sizing: unset; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-style: inherit; font-variant: inherit; font-weight: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 15px; line-height: inherit; font-family: se-nanumgothic, arial, &quot;\\B098눔고딕&quot;, nanumgothic, sans-serif; font-optical-sizing: inherit; font-size-adjust: inherit; font-kerning: inherit; font-feature-settings: inherit; font-variation-settings: inherit; font-language-override: inherit; vertical-align: baseline; text-decoration: none !important; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><b style="box-sizing: unset; font-weight: 700; background-color: inherit; font-family: inherit;">네이버 블로그는 아직 우리 회사를 모르는 고객에게도 발견될 기회를 만들어줍니다.</b></span></p><p class="se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- " id="SE-c5f8d5bd-f6fb-4dd9-8709-3c330f1310aa" style="margin: 0px; padding: 0px; box-sizing: unset; border: 0px; font-style: inherit; font-variant: inherit; font-weight: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 11px; line-height: 1.8; font-family: inherit; font-optical-sizing: inherit; font-size-adjust: inherit; font-kerning: inherit; font-feature-settings: inherit; font-variation-settings: inherit; font-language-override: inherit; vertical-align: baseline; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: break-word; white-space: break-spaces; text-align: left;"><span class="se-fs- se-ff-   se-decoration-unset" id="SE-0548fcfc-945b-4d5c-9f01-70cee2f64169" style="box-sizing: unset; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-style: inherit; font-variant: inherit; font-weight: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 15px; line-height: inherit; font-family: se-nanumgothic, arial, &quot;\\B098눔고딕&quot;, nanumgothic, sans-serif; font-optical-sizing: inherit; font-size-adjust: inherit; font-kerning: inherit; font-feature-settings: inherit; font-variation-settings: inherit; font-language-override: inherit; vertical-align: baseline; text-decoration: none !important; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">​</span></p><p class="se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- " id="SE-d0f79108-f4da-4345-a95e-0698ad398d67" style="margin: 0px; padding: 0px; box-sizing: unset; border: 0px; font-style: inherit; font-variant: inherit; font-weight: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 11px; line-height: 1.8; font-family: inherit; font-optical-sizing: inherit; font-size-adjust: inherit; font-kerning: inherit; font-feature-settings: inherit; font-variation-settings: inherit; font-language-override: inherit; vertical-align: baseline; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: break-word; white-space: break-spaces; text-align: left;"><span class="se-fs- se-ff-   se-decoration-unset" id="SE-fe3a5424-1a47-4444-b5b0-57a46e5240db" style="box-sizing: unset; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-style: inherit; font-variant: inherit; font-weight: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 15px; line-height: inherit; font-family: se-nanumgothic, arial, &quot;\\B098눔고딕&quot;, nanumgothic, sans-serif; font-optical-sizing: inherit; font-size-adjust: inherit; font-kerning: inherit; font-feature-settings: inherit; font-variation-settings: inherit; font-language-override: inherit; vertical-align: baseline; text-decoration: none !important; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">예를 들어 산업용 카메라 제조 기업이라면, 회사명을 검색하는 고객만 기다릴 필요가 없습니다. '산업용 카메라 선택 기준', '머신비전 카메라 활용 사례'처럼 고객이 실제로 궁금해하는 주제로 콘텐츠를 발행할 수 있습니다.</span></p><p class="se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- " id="SE-faf41dd8-d46d-4093-b81f-41d27fda0736" style="margin: 0px; padding: 0px; box-sizing: unset; border: 0px; font-style: inherit; font-variant: inherit; font-weight: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 11px; line-height: 1.8; font-family: inherit; font-optical-sizing: inherit; font-size-adjust: inherit; font-kerning: inherit; font-feature-settings: inherit; font-variation-settings: inherit; font-language-override: inherit; vertical-align: baseline; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: break-word; white-space: break-spaces; text-align: left;"><span class="se-fs- se-ff-   se-decoration-unset" id="SE-ba0b3fd4-974a-412a-a439-5485f4b01ae4" style="box-sizing: unset; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-style: inherit; font-variant: inherit; font-weight: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 15px; line-height: inherit; font-family: se-nanumgothic, arial, &quot;\\B098눔고딕&quot;, nanumgothic, sans-serif; font-optical-sizing: inherit; font-size-adjust: inherit; font-kerning: inherit; font-feature-settings: inherit; font-variation-settings: inherit; font-language-override: inherit; vertical-align: baseline; text-decoration: none !important; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">​</span></p><p class="se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- " id="SE-5d344664-742d-4d2e-8bad-37ed23cbc455" style="margin: 0px; padding: 0px; box-sizing: unset; border: 0px; font-style: inherit; font-variant: inherit; font-weight: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 11px; line-height: 1.8; font-family: inherit; font-optical-sizing: inherit; font-size-adjust: inherit; font-kerning: inherit; font-feature-settings: inherit; font-variation-settings: inherit; font-language-override: inherit; vertical-align: baseline; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: break-word; white-space: break-spaces; text-align: left;"><span class="se-fs- se-ff-   se-decoration-unset" id="SE-267be133-9495-4077-a55f-2402740f7a5b" style="box-sizing: unset; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-style: inherit; font-variant: inherit; font-weight: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 15px; line-height: inherit; font-family: se-nanumgothic, arial, &quot;\\B098눔고딕&quot;, nanumgothic, sans-serif; font-optical-sizing: inherit; font-size-adjust: inherit; font-kerning: inherit; font-feature-settings: inherit; font-variation-settings: inherit; font-language-override: inherit; vertical-align: baseline; text-decoration: none !important; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">이렇게 검색하는 고객에게 유용한 정보를 제공하면서 자연스럽게 자사 제품과 기술력을 알리고, 잠재 고객과의 새로운 접점을 만들 수 있습니다.</span></p><p class="se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- " id="SE-d19a4cd5-1218-4c6e-ab0f-878ee4e565bf" style="margin: 0px; padding: 0px; box-sizing: unset; border: 0px; font-style: inherit; font-variant: inherit; font-weight: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 11px; line-height: 1.8; font-family: inherit; font-optical-sizing: inherit; font-size-adjust: inherit; font-kerning: inherit; font-feature-settings: inherit; font-variation-settings: inherit; font-language-override: inherit; vertical-align: baseline; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: break-word; white-space: break-spaces; text-align: left;"><span class="se-fs- se-ff-   se-decoration-unset" id="SE-0b38ddc4-1de3-41af-90bc-16dc4a9e074d" style="box-sizing: unset; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-style: inherit; font-variant: inherit; font-weight: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 15px; line-height: inherit; font-family: se-nanumgothic, arial, &quot;\\B098눔고딕&quot;, nanumgothic, sans-serif; font-optical-sizing: inherit; font-size-adjust: inherit; font-kerning: inherit; font-feature-settings: inherit; font-variation-settings: inherit; font-language-override: inherit; vertical-align: baseline; text-decoration: none !important; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><b style="box-sizing: unset; font-weight: 700; background-color: inherit; font-family: inherit;">​</b></span></p><p class="se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- " id="SE-5334f5c6-859c-4508-a3f6-ba0b3683efbf" style="margin: 0px; padding: 0px; box-sizing: unset; border: 0px; font-style: inherit; font-variant: inherit; font-weight: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 11px; line-height: 1.8; font-family: inherit; font-optical-sizing: inherit; font-size-adjust: inherit; font-kerning: inherit; font-feature-settings: inherit; font-variation-settings: inherit; font-language-override: inherit; vertical-align: baseline; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: break-word; white-space: break-spaces; text-align: left;"><span class="se-fs- se-ff-   se-decoration-unset" id="SE-1417288f-8fc2-40ce-90da-cf5d2e243528" style="box-sizing: unset; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-style: inherit; font-variant: inherit; font-weight: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 15px; line-height: inherit; font-family: se-nanumgothic, arial, &quot;\\B098눔고딕&quot;, nanumgothic, sans-serif; font-optical-sizing: inherit; font-size-adjust: inherit; font-kerning: inherit; font-feature-settings: inherit; font-variation-settings: inherit; font-language-override: inherit; vertical-align: baseline; text-decoration: none !important; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><b style="box-sizing: unset; font-weight: 700; background-color: inherit; font-family: inherit;">"고객이 우리 회사를 몰라도 괜찮습니다. 고객이 필요한 정보를 검색할 때, 우리 기업이 먼저 발견되면 됩니다."</b></span></p><p class="se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- " id="SE-d89e4a35-a5d3-41d0-9b81-c65c7a5698c9" style="margin: 0px; padding: 0px; box-sizing: unset; border: 0px; font-style: inherit; font-variant: inherit; font-weight: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 11px; line-height: 1.8; font-family: inherit; font-optical-sizing: inherit; font-size-adjust: inherit; font-kerning: inherit; font-feature-settings: inherit; font-variation-settings: inherit; font-language-override: inherit; vertical-align: baseline; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: break-word; white-space: break-spaces; text-align: left;"><span class="se-fs- se-ff-   se-decoration-unset" id="SE-93779943-591c-4451-bf0c-23050084b0cf" style="box-sizing: unset; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-style: inherit; font-variant: inherit; font-weight: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 15px; line-height: inherit; font-family: se-nanumgothic, arial, &quot;\\B098눔고딕&quot;, nanumgothic, sans-serif; font-optical-sizing: inherit; font-size-adjust: inherit; font-kerning: inherit; font-feature-settings: inherit; font-variation-settings: inherit; font-language-override: inherit; vertical-align: baseline; text-decoration: none !important;"><b style="box-sizing: unset; font-weight: 700; background-color: inherit; font-family: inherit;">​</b></span></p></div></div></div></div><div class="se-component se-quotation se-l-quotation_underline" id="SE-9908de89-0524-4d04-8d22-ce2069663d37" style="box-sizing: unset; margin: 40px 0px 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-variant-numeric: inherit; font-variant-east-asian: inherit; font-variant-alternates: inherit; font-variant-position: inherit; font-variant-emoji: inherit; font-weight: 400; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 12px; line-height: inherit; font-family: se-nanumgothic, arial, 나눔고딕, nanumgothic, sans-serif, Meiryo; font-optical-sizing: inherit; font-size-adjust: inherit; font-kerning: inherit; font-feature-settings: inherit; font-variation-settings: inherit; font-language-override: inherit; vertical-align: baseline; position: relative; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: left; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;"><div class="se-component-content" style="box-sizing: unset; margin: 0px auto; padding: 0px 40px; border: 0px; font: inherit; vertical-align: baseline; max-width: 100%; position: relative;"><div class="se-section se-section-quotation se-l-quotation_underline" style="box-sizing: unset; margin: 0px auto; padding: 10px 0px; border: 0px; font: inherit; vertical-align: baseline;"><blockquote class="se-quotation-container" style="box-sizing: border-box; margin: auto; padding: 35px 0px 20px; border-width: 0px 0px 1px; border-style: none none solid; border-color: currentcolor currentcolor rgb(155, 155, 155); border-image: none; font: inherit; vertical-align: baseline; quotes: none; position: relative;"><div class="se-module se-module-text se-quote" style="box-sizing: unset; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font: inherit; vertical-align: baseline;"><p class="se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- " id="SE-5e311174-1ae4-4779-b6e0-7a344035d18b" style="margin: 0px; padding: 0px; box-sizing: unset; border: 0px; font-style: inherit; font-variant: inherit; font-weight: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 11px; line-height: 1.8; font-family: inherit; font-optical-sizing: inherit; font-size-adjust: inherit; font-kerning: inherit; font-feature-settings: inherit; font-variation-settings: inherit; font-language-override: inherit; vertical-align: baseline; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: break-word; white-space: break-spaces; text-align: left;"><span class="se-fs- se-ff-   " id="SE-b71350ab-232b-411f-8ece-f363eb547627" style="box-sizing: unset; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-style: inherit; font-variant: inherit; font-weight: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 19px; line-height: inherit; font-family: se-nanummyeongjo, arial, &quot;\\B098눔명조&quot;, nanummyeongjo, serif; font-optical-sizing: inherit; font-size-adjust: inherit; font-kerning: inherit; font-feature-settings: inherit; font-variation-settings: inherit; font-language-override: inherit; vertical-align: baseline; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">2. 기업 신뢰도 구축 : 고객은 문의하기 전에 이미 우리 회사를 평가하고 있습니다.</span></p></div></blockquote></div></div></div><div class="se-component se-text se-l-default" id="SE-2fbad2b9-fa29-432c-b568-a6161e4139bc" style="box-sizing: unset; margin: 40px 0px 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-variant-numeric: inherit; font-variant-east-asian: inherit; font-variant-alternates: inherit; font-variant-position: inherit; font-variant-emoji: inherit; font-weight: 400; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 12px; line-height: inherit; font-family: se-nanumgothic, arial, 나눔고딕, nanumgothic, sans-serif, Meiryo; font-optical-sizing: inherit; font-size-adjust: inherit; font-kerning: inherit; font-feature-settings: inherit; font-variation-settings: inherit; font-language-override: inherit; vertical-align: baseline; position: relative; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: left; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;"><div class="se-component-content" style="box-sizing: unset; margin: 0px auto; padding: 0px 40px; border: 0px; font: inherit; vertical-align: baseline; max-width: 100%;"><div class="se-section se-section-text se-l-default" style="box-sizing: unset; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font: inherit; vertical-align: baseline;"><div class="se-module se-module-text" style="box-sizing: unset; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font: inherit; vertical-align: baseline;"><p class="se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- " id="SE-df6ab87d-9c7d-470f-86c2-d5b81f109786" style="margin: 0px; padding: 0px; box-sizing: unset; border: 0px; font-style: inherit; font-variant: inherit; font-weight: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 11px; line-height: 1.8; font-family: inherit; font-optical-sizing: inherit; font-size-adjust: inherit; font-kerning: inherit; font-feature-settings: inherit; font-variation-settings: inherit; font-language-override: inherit; vertical-align: baseline; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: break-word; white-space: break-spaces; text-align: left;"><span class="se-fs- se-ff- se-weight-unset  se-decoration-unset" id="SE-e5839b15-f312-4130-ad52-73e926b87867" style="box-sizing: unset; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-style: inherit; font-variant: inherit; font-weight: 400 !important; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 15px; line-height: inherit; font-family: se-nanumgothic, arial, &quot;\\B098눔고딕&quot;, nanumgothic, sans-serif; font-optical-sizing: inherit; font-size-adjust: inherit; font-kerning: inherit; font-feature-settings: inherit; font-variation-settings: inherit; font-language-override: inherit; vertical-align: baseline; text-decoration: none !important; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">고객은 제품이나 서비스를 구매하기 전, 여러 기업의 기술력과 실적을 비교하며 신뢰할 수 있는 업체인지 판단합니다.</span></p><p class="se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- " id="SE-80eac7a3-98dd-40ea-941b-4b5b682acded" style="margin: 0px; padding: 0px; box-sizing: unset; border: 0px; font-style: inherit; font-variant: inherit; font-weight: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 11px; line-height: 1.8; font-family: inherit; font-optical-sizing: inherit; font-size-adjust: inherit; font-kerning: inherit; font-feature-settings: inherit; font-variation-settings: inherit; font-language-override: inherit; vertical-align: baseline; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: break-word; white-space: break-spaces; text-align: left;"><span class="se-fs- se-ff- se-weight-unset  se-decoration-unset" id="SE-9aca3f1b-26c4-4a70-9f58-dafcf8892d7f" style="box-sizing: unset; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-style: inherit; font-variant: inherit; font-weight: 400 !important; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 15px; line-height: inherit; font-family: se-nanumgothic, arial, &quot;\\B098눔고딕&quot;, nanumgothic, sans-serif; font-optical-sizing: inherit; font-size-adjust: inherit; font-kerning: inherit; font-feature-settings: inherit; font-variation-settings: inherit; font-language-override: inherit; vertical-align: baseline; text-decoration: none !important; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">​</span></p><p class="se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- " id="SE-04fd0f20-864d-4269-b9a1-3e46eb15717b" style="margin: 0px; padding: 0px; box-sizing: unset; border: 0px; font-style: inherit; font-variant: inherit; font-weight: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 11px; line-height: 1.8; font-family: inherit; font-optical-sizing: inherit; font-size-adjust: inherit; font-kerning: inherit; font-feature-settings: inherit; font-variation-settings: inherit; font-language-override: inherit; vertical-align: baseline; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: break-word; white-space: break-spaces; text-align: left;"><span class="se-fs- se-ff- se-weight-unset  se-decoration-unset" id="SE-e53eeb28-181f-468b-b07b-ba91a76435e5" style="box-sizing: unset; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-style: inherit; font-variant: inherit; font-weight: 400 !important; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 15px; line-height: inherit; font-family: se-nanumgothic, arial, &quot;\\B098눔고딕&quot;, nanumgothic, sans-serif; font-optical-sizing: inherit; font-size-adjust: inherit; font-kerning: inherit; font-feature-settings: inherit; font-variation-settings: inherit; font-language-override: inherit; vertical-align: baseline; text-decoration: none !important; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">실제로 글로벌 B2B 구매자 약 4,000명을 대상으로 한 </span><span class="se-fs- se-ff-   se-decoration-unset" id="SE-4bd8c4d8-0916-4793-bbaa-9db26f8163ba" style="box-sizing: unset; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-style: inherit; font-variant: inherit; font-weight: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 15px; line-height: inherit; font-family: se-nanumgothic, arial, &quot;\\B098눔고딕&quot;, nanumgothic, sans-serif; font-optical-sizing: inherit; font-size-adjust: inherit; font-kerning: inherit; font-feature-settings: inherit; font-variation-settings: inherit; font-language-override: inherit; vertical-align: baseline; text-decoration: none !important; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><b style="box-sizing: unset; font-weight: 700; background-color: inherit; font-family: inherit;">6sense의 2025년 조사에 따르면, 구매 조직의 94%가 판매 기업과 처음 접촉하기 전에 이미 후보 업체의 선호 순위를 정한 것으로 나타났습니다.</b></span></p><p class="se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- " id="SE-269d3c11-464f-4371-a0b6-ed2660c46fd8" style="margin: 0px; padding: 0px; box-sizing: unset; border: 0px; font-style: inherit; font-variant: inherit; font-weight: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 11px; line-height: 1.8; font-family: inherit; font-optical-sizing: inherit; font-size-adjust: inherit; font-kerning: inherit; font-feature-settings: inherit; font-variation-settings: inherit; font-language-override: inherit; vertical-align: baseline; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: break-word; white-space: break-spaces; text-align: left;"><span class="se-fs- se-ff- se-weight-unset  se-decoration-unset" id="SE-f96727d7-51eb-4988-bb6a-ec38f1312f7e" style="box-sizing: unset; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-style: inherit; font-variant: inherit; font-weight: 400 !important; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 15px; line-height: inherit; font-family: se-nanumgothic, arial, &quot;\\B098눔고딕&quot;, nanumgothic, sans-serif; font-optical-sizing: inherit; font-size-adjust: inherit; font-kerning: inherit; font-feature-settings: inherit; font-variation-settings: inherit; font-language-override: inherit; vertical-align: baseline; text-decoration: none !important; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">​</span></p><p class="se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- " id="SE-f52de729-e8b7-49b8-9cea-f8f7fbe8c6c0" style="margin: 0px; padding: 0px; box-sizing: unset; border: 0px; font-style: inherit; font-variant: inherit; font-weight: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 11px; line-height: 1.8; font-family: inherit; font-optical-sizing: inherit; font-size-adjust: inherit; font-kerning: inherit; font-feature-settings: inherit; font-variation-settings: inherit; font-language-override: inherit; vertical-align: baseline; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: break-word; white-space: break-spaces; text-align: left;"><span class="se-fs- se-ff- se-weight-unset  se-decoration-unset" id="SE-bd0be0ee-2188-4d8a-b477-a26c286bf4e4" style="box-sizing: unset; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-style: inherit; font-variant: inherit; font-weight: 400 !important; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 15px; line-height: inherit; font-family: se-nanumgothic, arial, &quot;\\B098눔고딕&quot;, nanumgothic, sans-serif; font-optical-sizing: inherit; font-size-adjust: inherit; font-kerning: inherit; font-feature-settings: inherit; font-variation-settings: inherit; font-language-override: inherit; vertical-align: baseline; text-decoration: none !important; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">물론 해외 B2B 시장의 조사 결과가 국내 네이버 블로그의 효과를 직접 입증하는 것은 아닙니다. 하지만 고객이 문의하기 전부터 기업에 대한 정보를 수집하고 평가한다는 점은 주목할 필요가 있습니다.</span></p><p class="se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- " id="SE-fd556e04-45f5-40f2-b5cd-988e97284e9b" style="margin: 0px; padding: 0px; box-sizing: unset; border: 0px; font-style: inherit; font-variant: inherit; font-weight: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 11px; line-height: 1.8; font-family: inherit; font-optical-sizing: inherit; font-size-adjust: inherit; font-kerning: inherit; font-feature-settings: inherit; font-variation-settings: inherit; font-language-override: inherit; vertical-align: baseline; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: break-word; white-space: break-spaces; text-align: left;"><span class="se-fs- se-ff- se-weight-unset  se-decoration-unset" id="SE-a9625e6b-79eb-4731-ad37-6cd1dd043140" style="box-sizing: unset; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-style: inherit; font-variant: inherit; font-weight: 400 !important; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 15px; line-height: inherit; font-family: se-nanumgothic, arial, &quot;\\B098눔고딕&quot;, nanumgothic, sans-serif; font-optical-sizing: inherit; font-size-adjust: inherit; font-kerning: inherit; font-feature-settings: inherit; font-variation-settings: inherit; font-language-override: inherit; vertical-align: baseline; text-decoration: none !important; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">​</span></p><p class="se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- " id="SE-f1222955-7cf5-460e-82f1-fe807ea752ed" style="margin: 0px; padding: 0px; box-sizing: unset; border: 0px; font-style: inherit; font-variant: inherit; font-weight: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 11px; line-height: 1.8; font-family: inherit; font-optical-sizing: inherit; font-size-adjust: inherit; font-kerning: inherit; font-feature-settings: inherit; font-variation-settings: inherit; font-language-override: inherit; vertical-align: baseline; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: break-word; white-space: break-spaces; text-align: left;"><span class="se-fs- se-ff- se-weight-unset  se-decoration-unset" id="SE-d750ad7f-e13b-407d-bb13-e800c6e7ab87" style="box-sizing: unset; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-style: inherit; font-variant: inherit; font-weight: 400 !important; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 15px; line-height: inherit; font-family: se-nanumgothic, arial, &quot;\\B098눔고딕&quot;, nanumgothic, sans-serif; font-optical-sizing: inherit; font-size-adjust: inherit; font-kerning: inherit; font-feature-settings: inherit; font-variation-settings: inherit; font-language-override: inherit; vertical-align: baseline; text-decoration: none !important; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">기업은 네이버 블로그에 </span><span class="se-fs- se-ff-   se-decoration-unset" id="SE-48971b7b-4754-4218-ab06-4c07617875f3" style="box-sizing: unset; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-style: inherit; font-variant: inherit; font-weight: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 15px; line-height: inherit; font-family: se-nanumgothic, arial, &quot;\\B098눔고딕&quot;, nanumgothic, sans-serif; font-optical-sizing: inherit; font-size-adjust: inherit; font-kerning: inherit; font-feature-settings: inherit; font-variation-settings: inherit; font-language-override: inherit; vertical-align: baseline; text-decoration: none !important; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><b style="box-sizing: unset; font-weight: 700; background-color: inherit; font-family: inherit;">기술력, 시공 사례, 고객사 협업 사례, 실제 프로젝트 성과 등</b></span><span class="se-fs- se-ff- se-weight-unset  se-decoration-unset" id="SE-aa892a36-9755-4ae5-a148-c312b63fc02f" style="box-sizing: unset; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-style: inherit; font-variant: inherit; font-weight: 400 !important; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 15px; line-height: inherit; font-family: se-nanumgothic, arial, &quot;\\B098눔고딕&quot;, nanumgothic, sans-serif; font-optical-sizing: inherit; font-size-adjust: inherit; font-kerning: inherit; font-feature-settings: inherit; font-variation-settings: inherit; font-language-override: inherit; vertical-align: baseline; text-decoration: none !important; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">을 꾸준히 기록함으로써 고객이 직접 확인할 수 있는 신뢰의 근거를 쌓을 수 있습니다.</span></p><p class="se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- " id="SE-ecdac059-d4bc-44f7-a323-efb209281833" style="margin: 0px; padding: 0px; box-sizing: unset; border: 0px; font-style: inherit; font-variant: inherit; font-weight: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 11px; line-height: 1.8; font-family: inherit; font-optical-sizing: inherit; font-size-adjust: inherit; font-kerning: inherit; font-feature-settings: inherit; font-variation-settings: inherit; font-language-override: inherit; vertical-align: baseline; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: break-word; white-space: break-spaces; text-align: left;"><span class="se-fs- se-ff- se-weight-unset  se-decoration-unset" id="SE-3c6b5f16-7288-4eb2-b067-66ad46cb4042" style="box-sizing: unset; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-style: inherit; font-variant: inherit; font-weight: 400 !important; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 15px; line-height: inherit; font-family: se-nanumgothic, arial, &quot;\\B098눔고딕&quot;, nanumgothic, sans-serif; font-optical-sizing: inherit; font-size-adjust: inherit; font-kerning: inherit; font-feature-settings: inherit; font-variation-settings: inherit; font-language-override: inherit; vertical-align: baseline; text-decoration: none !important; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">​</span></p><p class="se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- " id="SE-767c790f-9e4d-4dae-bb86-c1adb88a0e40" style="margin: 0px; padding: 0px; box-sizing: unset; border: 0px; font-style: inherit; font-variant: inherit; font-weight: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 11px; line-height: 1.8; font-family: inherit; font-optical-sizing: inherit; font-size-adjust: inherit; font-kerning: inherit; font-feature-settings: inherit; font-variation-settings: inherit; font-language-override: inherit; vertical-align: baseline; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: break-word; white-space: break-spaces; text-align: left;"><span class="se-fs- se-ff- se-weight-unset  se-decoration-unset" id="SE-fa0b0986-045f-446a-bbc8-309c1d06dc43" style="box-sizing: unset; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-style: inherit; font-variant: inherit; font-weight: 400 !important; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 15px; line-height: inherit; font-family: se-nanumgothic, arial, &quot;\\B098눔고딕&quot;, nanumgothic, sans-serif; font-optical-sizing: inherit; font-size-adjust: inherit; font-kerning: inherit; font-feature-settings: inherit; font-variation-settings: inherit; font-language-override: inherit; vertical-align: baseline; text-decoration: none !important; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">단순히 "우리 회사는 잘합니다"라고 홍보하는 것보다, 실제로 어떤 일을 해왔고 어떤 성과를 만들어냈는지 보여주는 것이 훨씬 설득력 있습니다.</span></p><p class="se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- " id="SE-8152eb45-1eba-4c7c-b7dc-90ceafa7481b" style="margin: 0px; padding: 0px; box-sizing: unset; border: 0px; font-style: inherit; font-variant: inherit; font-weight: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 11px; line-height: 1.8; font-family: inherit; font-optical-sizing: inherit; font-size-adjust: inherit; font-kerning: inherit; font-feature-settings: inherit; font-variation-settings: inherit; font-language-override: inherit; vertical-align: baseline; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: break-word; white-space: break-spaces; text-align: left;"><span class="se-fs- se-ff-   se-decoration-unset" id="SE-47216a71-67a2-45ae-be0e-8ef571003976" style="box-sizing: unset; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-style: inherit; font-variant: inherit; font-weight: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 15px; line-height: inherit; font-family: se-nanumgothic, arial, &quot;\\B098눔고딕&quot;, nanumgothic, sans-serif; font-optical-sizing: inherit; font-size-adjust: inherit; font-kerning: inherit; font-feature-settings: inherit; font-variation-settings: inherit; font-language-override: inherit; vertical-align: baseline; text-decoration: none !important; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><b style="box-sizing: unset; font-weight: 700; background-color: inherit; font-family: inherit;">​</b></span></p><p class="se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- " id="SE-90d12c1d-0d6c-4413-bc9c-7424d1992d50" style="margin: 0px; padding: 0px; box-sizing: unset; border: 0px; font-style: inherit; font-variant: inherit; font-weight: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 11px; line-height: 1.8; font-family: inherit; font-optical-sizing: inherit; font-size-adjust: inherit; font-kerning: inherit; font-feature-settings: inherit; font-variation-settings: inherit; font-language-override: inherit; vertical-align: baseline; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: break-word; white-space: break-spaces; text-align: left;"><span class="se-fs- se-ff-   se-decoration-unset" id="SE-605c2e97-0a1d-42c6-b2ca-a74e09bc38e9" style="box-sizing: unset; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-style: inherit; font-variant: inherit; font-weight: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 15px; line-height: 