ace: break-spaces; text-align: left;"><span class="se-fs- se-ff- se-weight-unset  se-decoration-unset" id="SE-e2c37467-62b1-4ef4-a63f-72e7831377b4" style="box-sizing: unset; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-style: inherit; font-variant: inherit; font-weight: 400 !important; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 15px; line-height: inherit; font-family: se-nanumgothic, arial, &quot;\\B098눔고딕&quot;, nanumgothic, sans-serif; font-optical-sizing: inherit; font-size-adjust: inherit; font-kerning: inherit; font-feature-settings: inherit; font-variation-settings: inherit; font-language-override: inherit; vertical-align: baseline; text-decoration: none !important; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">검색광고는 일반적으로 광고 집행을 중단하면 노출도 함께 중단됩니다. 하지만 네이버 블로그에 발행한 콘텐츠는 시간이 지나도 검색을 통해 새로운 고객에게 발견될 가능성이 있습니다.</span></p><p class="se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- " id="SE-a2104418-4ee1-4106-8d1e-65d6d78a10db" style="margin: 0px; padding: 0px; box-sizing: unset; border: 0px; font-style: inherit; font-variant: inherit; font-weight: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 11px; line-height: 1.8; font-family: inherit; font-optical-sizing: inherit; font-size-adjust: inherit; font-kerning: inherit; font-feature-settings: inherit; font-variation-settings: inherit; font-language-override: inherit; vertical-align: baseline; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: break-word; white-space: break-spaces; text-align: left;"><span class="se-fs- se-ff- se-weight-unset  se-decoration-unset" id="SE-e29e650d-96fb-4480-9a7e-de8004e09da8" style="box-sizing: unset; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-style: inherit; font-variant: inherit; font-weight: 400 !important; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 15px; line-height: inherit; font-family: se-nanumgothic, arial, &quot;\\B098눔고딕&quot;, nanumgothic, sans-serif; font-optical-sizing: inherit; font-size-adjust: inherit; font-kerning: inherit; font-feature-settings: inherit; font-variation-settings: inherit; font-language-override: inherit; vertical-align: baseline; text-decoration: none !important; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">​</span></p><p class="se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- " id="SE-61d3564c-32b4-4531-98bd-8eeb24640601" style="margin: 0px; padding: 0px; box-sizing: unset; border: 0px; font-style: inherit; font-variant: inherit; font-weight: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 11px; line-height: 1.8; font-family: inherit; font-optical-sizing: inherit; font-size-adjust: inherit; font-kerning: inherit; font-feature-settings: inherit; font-variation-settings: inherit; font-language-override: inherit; vertical-align: baseline; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: break-word; white-space: break-spaces; text-align: left;"><span class="se-fs- se-ff- se-weight-unset  se-decoration-unset" id="SE-d339f81f-dd7e-4727-ba8e-e3c475cc9bc9" style="box-sizing: unset; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-style: inherit; font-variant: inherit; font-weight: 400 !important; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 15px; line-height: inherit; font-family: se-nanumgothic, arial, &quot;\\B098눔고딕&quot;, nanumgothic, sans-serif; font-optical-sizing: inherit; font-size-adjust: inherit; font-kerning: inherit; font-feature-settings: inherit; font-variation-settings: inherit; font-language-override: inherit; vertical-align: baseline; text-decoration: none !important; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">예를 들어 제품의 주요 기능, 사용 방법, 실제 활용 사례 등을 블로그에 작성해 두면 해당 정보를 찾는 고객이 몇 주, 몇 달 뒤에도 콘텐츠를 접할 수 있습니다.</span></p><p class="se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- " id="SE-436365de-a72e-4b07-9706-a9881bfdbde2" style="margin: 0px; padding: 0px; box-sizing: unset; border: 0px; font-style: inherit; font-variant: inherit; font-weight: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 11px; line-height: 1.8; font-family: inherit; font-optical-sizing: inherit; font-size-adjust: inherit; font-kerning: inherit; font-feature-settings: inherit; font-variation-settings: inherit; font-language-override: inherit; vertical-align: baseline; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: break-word; white-space: break-spaces; text-align: left;"><span class="se-fs- se-ff- se-weight-unset  se-decoration-unset" id="SE-966dfb74-1074-4d2a-9fff-e4b30b7355ef" style="box-sizing: unset; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-style: inherit; font-variant: inherit; font-weight: 400 !important; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 15px; line-height: inherit; font-family: se-nanumgothic, arial, &quot;\\B098눔고딕&quot;, nanumgothic, sans-serif; font-optical-sizing: inherit; font-size-adjust: inherit; font-kerning: inherit; font-feature-settings: inherit; font-variation-settings: inherit; font-language-override: inherit; vertical-align: baseline; text-decoration: none !important; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">​</span></p><p class="se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- " id="SE-ffa71c52-5325-4e1c-a433-98095732bf81" style="margin: 0px; padding: 0px; box-sizing: unset; border: 0px; font-style: inherit; font-variant: inherit; font-weight: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 11px; line-height: 1.8; font-family: inherit; font-optical-sizing: inherit; font-size-adjust: inherit; font-kerning: inherit; font-feature-settings: inherit; font-variation-settings: inherit; font-language-override: inherit; vertical-align: baseline; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: break-word; white-space: break-spaces; text-align: left;"><span class="se-fs- se-ff- se-weight-unset  se-decoration-unset" id="SE-b92bbcb8-a55a-4950-9c18-e05124d2bea4" style="box-sizing: unset; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-style: inherit; font-variant: inherit; font-weight: 400 !important; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 15px; line-height: inherit; font-family: se-nanumgothic, arial, &quot;\\B098눔고딕&quot;, nanumgothic, sans-serif; font-optical-sizing: inherit; font-size-adjust: inherit; font-kerning: inherit; font-feature-settings: inherit; font-variation-settings: inherit; font-language-override: inherit; vertical-align: baseline; text-decoration: none !important; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">물론 모든 글이 검색 상위에 노출되거나 지속적인 방문을 보장하는 것은 아닙니다. 하지만 </span><span class="se-fs- se-ff-   se-decoration-unset" id="SE-7df13703-7f77-45c6-8332-095f304648a4" style="box-sizing: unset; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-style: inherit; font-variant: inherit; font-weight: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 15px; line-height: inherit; font-family: se-nanumgothic, arial, &quot;\\B098눔고딕&quot;, nanumgothic, sans-serif; font-optical-sizing: inherit; font-size-adjust: inherit; font-kerning: inherit; font-feature-settings: inherit; font-variation-settings: inherit; font-language-override: inherit; vertical-align: baseline; text-decoration: none !important; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><b style="box-sizing: unset; font-weight: 700; background-color: inherit; font-family: inherit;">고객이 필요로 하는 유용한 정보를 꾸준히 축적한다면, 장기적으로 검색 유입을 기대할 수 있는 콘텐츠 자산을 구축할 수 있습니다.</b></span></p><p class="se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- " id="SE-5a0d1005-ae44-4a39-a0c8-248670b91428" style="margin: 0px; padding: 0px; box-sizing: unset; border: 0px; font-style: inherit; font-variant: inherit; font-weight: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 11px; line-height: 1.8; font-family: inherit; font-optical-sizing: inherit; font-size-adjust: inherit; font-kerning: inherit; font-feature-settings: inherit; font-variation-settings: inherit; font-language-override: inherit; vertical-align: baseline; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: break-word; white-space: break-spaces; text-align: left;"><span class="se-fs- se-ff- se-weight-unset  se-decoration-unset" id="SE-5b054ac8-4927-489a-861c-8e1e954b987e" style="box-sizing: unset; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-style: inherit; font-variant: inherit; font-weight: 400 !important; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 15px; line-height: inherit; font-family: se-nanumgothic, arial, &quot;\\B098눔고딕&quot;, nanumgothic, sans-serif; font-optical-sizing: inherit; font-size-adjust: inherit; font-kerning: inherit; font-feature-settings: inherit; font-variation-settings: inherit; font-language-override: inherit; vertical-align: baseline; text-decoration: none !important; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">​</span></p><p class="se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- " id="SE-ccbe3344-5fd2-4ecc-9c5f-3d4bd433442c" style="margin: 0px; padding: 0px; box-sizing: unset; border: 0px; font-style: inherit; font-variant: inherit; font-weight: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 11px; line-height: 1.8; font-family: inherit; font-optical-sizing: inherit; font-size-adjust: inherit; font-kerning: inherit; font-feature-settings: inherit; font-variation-settings: inherit; font-language-override: inherit; vertical-align: baseline; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: break-word; white-space: break-spaces; text-align: left;"><span class="se-fs- se-ff- se-weight-unset  se-decoration-unset" id="SE-7dbe439a-5e8b-4ac9-b73d-93bb49dca8d8" style="box-sizing: unset; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-style: inherit; font-variant: inherit; font-weight: 400 !important; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 15px; line-height: inherit; font-family: se-nanumgothic, arial, &quot;\\B098눔고딕&quot;, nanumgothic, sans-serif; font-optical-sizing: inherit; font-size-adjust: inherit; font-kerning: inherit; font-feature-settings: inherit; font-variation-settings: inherit; font-language-override: inherit; vertical-align: baseline; text-decoration: none !important; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">특히 제품 소개, 자주 묻는 질문, 실제 프로젝트 사례 등은 영업 담당자가 고객 상담 과정에서 공유할 수 있는 설명 자료로도 활용할 수 있습니다.</span></p><p class="se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- " id="SE-f9549087-36cb-4fa9-aff8-c4425a5a37bc" style="margin: 0px; padding: 0px; box-sizing: unset; border: 0px; font-style: inherit; font-variant: inherit; font-weight: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 11px; line-height: 1.8; font-family: inherit; font-optical-sizing: inherit; font-size-adjust: inherit; font-kerning: inherit; font-feature-settings: inherit; font-variation-settings: inherit; font-language-override: inherit; vertical-align: baseline; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: break-word; white-space: break-spaces; text-align: left;"><span class="se-fs- se-ff- se-weight-unset  se-decoration-unset" id="SE-3a0e7621-8ed1-45f2-9294-d0923b7c4c05" style="box-sizing: unset; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-style: inherit; font-variant: inherit; font-weight: 400 !important; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 15px; line-height: inherit; font-family: se-nanumgothic, arial, &quot;\\B098눔고딕&quot;, nanumgothic, sans-serif; font-optical-sizing: inherit; font-size-adjust: inherit; font-kerning: inherit; font-feature-settings: inherit; font-variation-settings: inherit; font-language-override: inherit; vertical-align: baseline; text-decoration: none !important; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">​</span></p><p class="se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- " id="SE-00831f41-6826-4a4a-80cb-7d5f2a01f727" style="margin: 0px; padding: 0px; box-sizing: unset; border: 0px; font-style: inherit; font-variant: inherit; font-weight: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 11px; line-height: 1.8; font-family: inherit; font-optical-sizing: inherit; font-size-adjust: inherit; font-kerning: inherit; font-feature-settings: inherit; font-variation-settings: inherit; font-language-override: inherit; vertical-align: baseline; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: break-word; white-space: break-spaces; text-align: left;"><span class="se-fs- se-ff-   se-decoration-unset" id="SE-c3cabf8c-bfed-465e-9d84-254ae8b9d96b" style="box-sizing: unset; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-style: inherit; font-variant: inherit; font-weight: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 15px; line-height: inherit; font-family: se-nanumgothic, arial, &quot;\\B098눔고딕&quot;, nanumgothic, sans-serif; font-optical-sizing: inherit; font-size-adjust: inherit; font-kerning: inherit; font-feature-settings: inherit; font-variation-settings: inherit; font-language-override: inherit; vertical-align: baseline; text-decoration: none !important; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><b style="box-sizing: unset; font-weight: 700; background-color: inherit; font-family: inherit;">"광고는 멈추면 노출도 멈추지만, 잘 작성한 콘텐츠는 시간이 지나도 새로운 고객을 만날 기회가 됩니다."<div class="autosourcing-stub-extra" style="box-sizing: unset; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font: inherit; vertical-align: baseline; zoom: 1; opacity: 1;"><p style="margin: 11px 0px 7px; padding: 0px; box-sizing: unset; border: 0px; font-style: normal; font-variant: inherit; font-weight: normal; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 12px; line-height: inherit; font-family: Dotum; font-optical-sizing: inherit; font-size-adjust: inherit; font-kerning: inherit; font-feature-settings: inherit; font-variation-settings: inherit; font-language-override: inherit; vertical-align: baseline;"><strong style="box-sizing: unset; padding: 0px 7px 0px 0px;">[출처]</strong> <a href="https://blog.naver.com/shooble_official/224446599221" target="_blank" style="text-decoration: none; color: inherit; cursor: pointer; box-sizing: unset; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font: inherit; vertical-align: baseline;">홈페이지도 있는데, 기업 블로그까지 운영해야 할까요?</a><span style="box-sizing: unset; margin: 0px; padding: 0px 7px 0px 5px; border: 0px; font: inherit; vertical-align: baseline;">|</span><strong style="box-sizing: unset; padding: 0px 7px 0px 0px;">작성자</strong> <a href="https://blog.naver.com/shooble_official" target="_blank" style="text-decoration: none; color: inherit; cursor: pointer; box-sizing: unset; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font: inherit; vertical-align: baseline;">shooble_official</a></p></div></b></span></p></div></div></div></div><!--EndFragment-->
